The segmentation fault might be caused by the missing parameter in the summation function declaration. There is a missing "int" type in the parameter list.

Change the line:

```c
int summation(int n1, n2);
```

to

```c
int summation(int n1, int n2);
```

Another issue I noticed is that you are adding printf statements without newline characters `\n` in your test command section. Add `\n` at the end of each printf statement:

```c
printf("100 + 199 = %d\n", n1);
printf("211999 - 9876 = %d\n", n2);
printf("5^5 = %d\n", n3);
printf("floor 2004/5 = %d\n", n4);
printf("1s in 100101010001011110011 = %d\n", n5);
printf("sum [10,100] = %d\n", n6);
printf("6! = %d\n", n7);
```

